s/origins/c255e80e-8dfd-4aee-a20b-30479580f54a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b5d6354dcae751e0d7efd5885c84535", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c35fec1a/uploads/origins/c255e80e-8dfd-4aee-a20b-30479580f54a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2157900533da5c9535aaee196eade83d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "木犀さん、はじめまして！\nいつも木犀さんの絵柄とデザインスタイルが大好きです！  \n今回、私のオリジナルキャラクターの新しい衣装デザインをしていただけませんでしょうか？    \n\n【テーマ】\n任務執行・戦闘用の機能性ワークウェア  \n\n【要素】\n·作業証／ネクタイ／タクティカルショルダーバッグ／ロングコート  \n·ユーティリティファッション（メカニカルなディテール）  \n·ブラック基調＋アクセントで鮮やかな色を散らす  \n\n【参考作品】\nhttps://skeb.jp/@mokusei0516/works/211  \nhttps://skeb.jp/@mokusei0516/works/375  \n\n【世界観/キャラクター】\n> 1990年代香港ノスタルジア × 裏世界怪談譚\n> 近未来的な都会が混ざった世界  \n\n符靈 \n23歳／182cm／黒髪 ／男性\n瞳色：左＝青/右＝黒灰\n・大陸出身の年上社会人／人の気持ちを読むのが得意だが支配欲が強い犬タイプ \n・任務の合間にバイオリンを演奏する\n・武器：中国刀（唐刀） \n\n 【キャラクター参考資料】 \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R46SxUbLQBXukH19xvI8oxSnAzFiV0Ji\n\n角や尻尾について、木犀さんにより良いアイデアがあれば、自由に改良・デザインしていただいても構いません ！\n\n  【使用用途】 \n個人鑑賞、SNSのアイコンやヘッダーとして使用  \n※友人間での少量のグッズ交換（商用・営利目的なし）も可能性としてあります。   \n\nご検討いただき、ありがとうございます！", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/419", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 2582204, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae5e34f6/uploads/outputs/1747ea08-250a-4644-9749-5d920bff1576?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45d03b11b54781ac94f76a4c83e9a94b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": 3, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae5e34f6/uploads/outputs/1747ea08-250a-4644-9749-5d920bff1576?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4cd0ab74d18af86cb0f95492b53fe894", "src_set": ""}, "body": "안녕하세요 당신의 작품을 정말 좋게 보고있던 버튜버입니다\n스팅어로 넣고싶어서 이렇게 문의 드립니다\n해당 캐릭터가 앉아서 다른데를 보고있다 정면을보고 놀랄때 고양이고 폴짝 뛰어서 화면을 앞발 두개로 도장을 찍듯이 화면을 누르는 느낌으로 끝내고싶습니다\nこんにちは。あなたの作品をよく見ていたバーチューバーです 今度機会があって作業を要請したいです\nリンクのキャラクターが座って違う方向を見ていてびっくりするような表情で正面を見ると猫が下から上に飛び上がる感じでぴょんと跳ねて両足で画面を塗装する感じで終わらせたいです\n理解を助けるため、似たような感じでファイル名を1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4に変えて添付しました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MTdDrejKdyTAdXgqLVvoW5pPdsLLpBtq?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/418", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 683132, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3263d331/uploads/outputs/e5ae865f-951c-4a94-a02b-19ad61d862b2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7141ce36ae4bfec9d60117e05a1c3e78", "src_set": ""}, "duration": 3, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3263d331/uploads/outputs/e5ae865f-951c-4a94-a02b-19ad61d862b2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=490c7912b439180d9c3709e1bfebef69", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのトランジションが大好きです!\n私のキャラクターをどう描くか見てみたいわ！\nクリエイティブな自由を存分に発揮してください！\n\n── ⋅ ⋅ ── ⋅ ⋅ ── ✦ ── ⋅ ⋅ ── ⋅ ⋅ ──\n\n私のキャラクターは、独りよがりの悪魔の大将です！\n以下の私のホームページでいろいろと紹介しています！\nhttps://fream.gg/fream\n\n髪の色はブルー（長い方）、ピンク、ティール（短い方）。\n舌は青くて、トゲトゲしたサメの歯があるんだ！鼻には白い絆創膏を貼っています！\n私のチークは青です！\n\nあと、スパイクっていう超かわいいマスコットがいるの！\nもしよかったら、彼も入れてあげてね！片目だけ \"X \"がついています！\n\nhttps://fream.gg/fream", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/417", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 2948204, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d1f048db/uploads/outputs/329fcb4a-5a7d-4588-808a-4af6bc1c5206?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca8ad645eb2a52253e5b9c0443a6aece", "src_set": ""}, "duration": 3, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d1f048db/uploads/outputs/329fcb4a-5a7d-4588-808a-4af6bc1c5206?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cf99153c2501fcf25c738a10702630cc", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、Muxi Painterさん。VTuber活動で使用するトランジションアニメーションを依頼したいと思います。私の名前はMIA、傭兵であり狙撃手です。私が実現したいのは、顔をフレームにかなり近づけて、フレームの左側から頭を突き出すアニメーションです。私は困惑しながら画面の右側を見ると、表情が困惑から恐怖へと変わりました。すると、灰色のネズミが画面の右側から飛び出してきて、私の頭を踏みつけ、気絶させてしまいました。この依頼を引き受けていただければ大変ありがたく思います。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/416", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa0eee0c/uploads/origins/70cc4f73-2a16-4f47-b0e6-e93c5efdf3a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8347f70420b85db0ed6b036abc3edfa1", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 3290418, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/415", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 3077850, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f2c9eab/uploads/outputs/be30252d-e810-4857-9efc-e3ca669fd67a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c67aebedbbc9cebd7cffc811afdfc5dc", "src_set": ""}, "duration": 3, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f2c9eab/uploads/outputs/be30252d-e810-4857-9efc-e3ca669fd67a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a60df84a564e64631e62c6d3fc9bc337", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！ロッククライマーVtuberのDyokrです。私のキャラクターのアートが欲しいです！ストリームのスティンガーとして使いたい。彼はいつも冗談を言い、体力を奨励する人物です。メインモデルはジャケットとバックパックを持っていますが、バックパックは自由に外してください！\n\n私のキャラクターはいつもジョークを飛ばし、ゲームと健康のバランスを奨励します。彼は主に体操とロッククライミングで運動しています。ポーズはお任せください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RnCEWZj0rMb0BQBe4e1Tqz361JQEoSJG?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/414", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 3481814, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/727ea467/uploads/origins/347c714b-c66c-45a7-a828-57a052d72ac6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb1734974aa8521151786d5e582e305a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/727ea467/uploads/origins/347c714b-c66c-45a7-a828-57a052d72ac6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=938a1cb4bea953d6169771c73792981a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、先生！先生のクールな衣装が大好きです！いつもすべてがとてもユニークです。もし、このデザインを将来のVtuberの衣装として使用することを許可してほしいです。もし、それが受け入れられ、より高い費用が必要であれば、私にアピールを送ってください！私の依頼を受け入れてくれることを願っています！\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PIFCZz69DCAJ77zZYgz5DCRtGPHahDgb?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/413", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 1909688, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7993c22/uploads/origins/e986f701-4853-4da7-b89a-f90cd3258091?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=290aa9cbc3d42bf1954809a8215b55d1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7993c22/uploads/origins/e986f701-4853-4da7-b89a-f90cd3258091?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=673bae388417e4e58240fb88cf7deaeb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I really love the previous works you made for me and would love to request another work!\n\nI'd love if you could please design 4 fantasy outfits for all seasons for this character:) summer, autumn, winter and spring! Her main colour palette is teal/blueish green, white and red! You can decide which of these colours you wish to be be the main theme for each design^^\n\nShe loves to wear a beret or accessories in her hair such as headbands or hair clips, etc to suit the occasion. \n\nYeri is a costume designer, she loves to stand out and has a 'popular girl' style. She's preppy, sociable confident and has a twisted yet whimsical temper. Her hair is white, her eyelashes are dark/black. \n\nId appreciate if you could include a version with a transparent PNG background as well^^ Thank you for your time!\n\n◇ https://toyhou.se/19438638.yeri", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/412", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a85dc40/uploads/origins/f8557d46-1e0e-4379-9871-ae33003906f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=574bc3d4e6dfb650a53e1f18b7908ec2", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 1578407, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/411", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 2815046, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b9aa9e0/uploads/origins/5d929028-2ec7-4032-9a28-a92935d55ffc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cfa0ed218c479d0558bcc657313cbbf", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b9aa9e0/uploads/origins/5d929028-2ec7-4032-9a28-a92935d55ffc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=43f9565deffd7d3f739e1f403e7457ea", "src_set": ""}, "body": "木犀seneiさん、こんにちは！あなたのデザインがとても好きなので、私のocの男性バージョンのデザインをお願いしたいです。\n私のocは18歳の人間の女の子（自称）で、毛先が紫に染まった黒髪で、髪の右側にはねじりがあり、髪の後ろ側には2つの輪っかがあります。そしてウサギの耳は取り外し可能（自称）。\n✔️ 彼女が男の子になったときのデザインをお願いします。髪の長さは肩にかかるくらいで、普段は三つ編みにしています。耳にピアスをしている。遊び好きだが優しい。シンプルなショートネイルをする予定。\n- 身長：177\n- 主な要素南米のビスカッチャ。(南米のビスカチャがどんなものか知らない人は、リンク先の「ビスカチャ」というファイルで見ることができる)\n- メインカラーは紫。\nリンク先には彼女の普段の服装やスタイルが載っています。自由に描いてください！\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/145fp8jUxJgwAOyHSzXolAXdaWV1B-E34?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/410", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 1540375, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dec5963a/uploads/origins/72dc4980-c29b-442c-8b0d-ce0d6dce8b22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1915e623beb06ab67832583d14899e91", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dec5963a/uploads/origins/72dc4980-c29b-442c-8b0d-ce0d6dce8b22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=98611e2e4e5e54ec79ac7598a4d2896b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello Kisai-san, my name is Adelie.\nI like Kisai-san's costume design so much that I requested it.\n\n▼Request.\nI would like to request a new costume for my original character.\nI would be happy if you could draw a mafia-like all-black coordinate.\nYou can arrange the hair style as you like.\n\nCharacter\nHeir to the French mafia / 16 years old / 145cm / brown hair / golden eyes\nHe has an inborn antisocial personality disorder. He is cold and heartless, always follows logical thinking, and maintains a blank expression.\n\n▼ Uses.\n-Icons, smartphone wallpapers, etc. for personal viewing\nMay be used as a reference material when requesting -skeb, etc.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VeEi9KP_QNl2WqeDSbOfGIbzcoNl8pyD?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/409", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 3509372, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/992bb1fc/uploads/origins/dfe9b36c-1cfd-408e-911c-00c76d9da874?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ccef52179adcb29ef6333f214dab8b8a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/992bb1fc/uploads/origins/dfe9b36c-1cfd-408e-911c-00c76d9da874?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9466127639c6d646ec82766de70dec1d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I really like how you design characters and clothing and would like to commission you to draw my VTuber OC.\n\nHe is African-American and is a herald of Zeus. He has long, black and curly hair in a ponytail and wears round glasses, golden earrings, and a necklace with a golden lightning bolt. \nHe wears a white fur blazer and a black suit with golden buttons. Also, he wears black pants with dress boots and a white cape hanging from his waist.\n\nI would like a front and back view of the character. You can play around with the pose and do whatever you think looks best.\n\nI have a sketch of my character, along with references in the Google Drive link to make things easier for you. \n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1a9YYQoDWWhij3qDGb5exyK42FiT6YPzO?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/408", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a96462ed/uploads/outputs/5f886887-5d17-4b31-8c48-25aa95e60629?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=af1f6b4d9ae69d229cd022cd240398b7", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "video", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 3290405, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/407", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/982d0db1/uploads/origins/0cca102a-ea96-4807-831b-e8d2c94f9e02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=821cc961a6a8a21dd278b3f2e5db3ce8", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 2794708, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/406", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/be4e3f36/uploads/outputs/5ed65a97-01b2-44af-a510-e8cf0f064bb2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0a5fcfa2d04d8ba9279ba13ded2c393a", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 3471931, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/405", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 3479661, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/11d4c3ad/uploads/origins/a14382b6-0481-4443-8927-2a3e152b51c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e60345063cfda781261ed85c3ea5aeb", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/11d4c3ad/uploads/origins/a14382b6-0481-4443-8927-2a3e152b51c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d84b20c0865b71f84d7360ee279d34b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, Ms. Rhinoceros! I saw your work on Skeb and liked the clothes you designed, so I sent you a request. I would like you to design a couple's dress for them! I hope it's a modern style, but I also like a lot of decorative designs!\n\n I especially like the dress you designed! Can you design a dress for the man with a little bit of this style in mind? But I would like the boy to wear long pants! https://skeb.jp/@mokusei0516/works/348\nI'd love it if there was a cute doll charm in a guy's cool outfit, since he has a secret love for dolls, and he brings his girlfriend's accessories with him!\n\nThe girl's dress should be a cute dress! The girl's dress should be a cute dress and the color should match the guy's dress. She is wearing a collar that he gave her.\nYou can refer to the relationship between the two people: the boy is a bad person who likes to bully and tease his girlfriend. The girl is very good-natured but very active. Together they sneak around in alleys with spray paint, drink at bars, and share milkshakes in the park.\n\nThe link contains reference pictures of the two of them!\n\nThank you so much for taking the time to read this long post to the end. Please feel free to ask for a resend if the requested amount is not worth it or is otherwise incomplete. If you still find it difficult, you can cancel your request, thank you very much.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/113AoibP9rHwH8Ctz9rBuf6c5iNiklw4-", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/404", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9fe1de9/uploads/outputs/971abb37-4a6a-4f96-8404-117c3b276b03?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dacdaaa2ecea42c31959bdc5a218f379", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/403", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/beb2a7f2/uploads/origins/ed563ca3-11e7-4315-bfe0-3de9c8ab0549?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=95c58246286f86b95d78e5639e405ac0", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/402", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 2052438, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f22f5aba/uploads/origins/d29ae542-ff35-401f-9fd1-65b482531135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cff94f07ea4cd263dcbcb117a9311757", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f22f5aba/uploads/origins/d29ae542-ff35-401f-9fd1-65b482531135?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28309ab6fc9a35ec00ec1474aaee4efc", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi! I love your art so much. I recently came across this beautiful artwork you made (https://skeb.jp/@mokusei0516/works/370) and was wondering if I could request my Vtuber drawn with a background as well?\n\nMy Vtuber is a purple cyberpunk kunoichi panda. She has red eyes, a beauty spot under her eye and one fang. She is very energetic, loves food, and loves fighting crime. For the background, could she be drawn in an alleyway? The pose can be completely up to you. In my references I have included her mascot who is a lemon, you are welcome to add him into the artwork too if you like. Please have fun and draw in a way that makes you happy. ^^\n\nOne more request, could I please receive the format in 16:9 so I can use it for thumbnails and social media?\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wGVIAb7FqbAWM1j10l2M5mq9mQ637TCv?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/401", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d342fa65/uploads/origins/da99e693-95b9-4fb1-8a7d-b572634a8cff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c3bcd3f5e484db9ab57680e4ff4e0785", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 1848222, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/400", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/72783508/uploads/outputs/cd8964ae-6e92-47cc-98ec-65f92606588d?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f18370585ecbd9a2d3fb80444e9ca0da", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 2942118, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/399", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d749c85/uploads/outputs/71c55b4c-4221-4b22-a8ca-8bf235cf2bb1?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8587802381c8d5d1189fcf297941da8b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": 3, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d749c85/uploads/outputs/71c55b4c-4221-4b22-a8ca-8bf235cf2bb1?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed527d85dbdf569dd166fd80dc5671dc", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello again!\n\nMy name is Kael'Draxus, since the previous request passed the date limit I'm requesting once more time in case you'd like to pursue on the project!\n\n-Character introduction-\n\nMy character's full name is Kael Draxus, he's a Monarch of Nature : a divinity.\nHe's a character carrying a mysterious vibe with an unchanging expression with a warm smile and gentle eyes.\nKael is a distinguished elf with each of his actions full of elegance, he may seem sometimes too systematic due to his mysterious vibe and an unchanged expression, but he is a person with a caring warm soul.\n\nI wish to request an animation will be used for a transition scene (stinger) animation ;\nAs my character has the ability to borrow power from other animals (as you can see on several references for the character) If you could make him transform through all three different forms while he's smiling mysteriously with his eyes staring at nothing, at the same time as the camera angle rotating a whole 180 degree from left to right it would be great!\nI think ending the scene with the character noticing the camera, giving a warm smile at it as it sweeps through it with his dragon tail, it would look nice!\n\nYou can freely choose the character's pose and accessories with all the informations given and the references I provided in the Drive link below!\n\nThank you~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fyYjEzeDxfB1tXe5PcYvVnjo-sloi09p?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/398", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 993483, "client_id": 1912675, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/97d17e64/uploads/outputs/1fab78ff-eb24-4bf7-adc4-bf3e5ddfed39?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7fafd090a81e1bae6bca86bb6ef2512", "src_set": ""}, "duration": 3, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/97d17e64/uploads/outputs/1fab78ff-eb24-4bf7-adc4-bf3e5ddfed39?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d3a12d4a90531ca57fdd12c1a1fa5521", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Here's my resent request! \n\nHello! I love your stinger animations and would love to request one for my vtuber, Pixxi!\n\nPixxi is a puppy girl that runs her own Adventurer's Guild! She has a playful and mischievous personality. She is often accompanied by her blue dog mascot that represents her fans! Please draw her in her main outfit (dark blue dress). You can choose if you would like to include her pink cardigan!\n\nHere is her reference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FgIIj0FvRxJVHhW5tV__F4Ss1apL_DgB?usp=drive_link\n\nFor the animation, I would like Pixxi to start by twirling her dagger and come up similar to what you did for Arya Kuroha's stinger animation (https://x.com/mokusei0516/status/1807248980474249344) except instead of her shattering the screen at the end, I would like her blue dog mascot to pop up and jump into the screen completely blocking it. Similar to your other work (https://skeb.jp/@mokusei0516/works/312). After hitting the screen, he slides down off screen while Pixxi has a happy, laughing expression and walks away disappearing from the screen.\n\nI will be using this on my streams on Twitch. Thank you so much for your consideration!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mokusei0516/works/397", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/80afdafc/uploads/outputs/761d6022-d084-445b-8adc-0bae